Correct colours on an XBGR screen.

The RISC OS screen is XBGR8888 but the 32bpp blitters write XRGB8888. The
game draws into an XRGB shadow surface and Paint() swaps red and blue one
word at a time (16 pixels at a time with NEON). SDL's own conversion was
several times slower.

For OpenTTD 14.1. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-openttd.

